# Analysis data for the microtubule work: ~47 GB of simulated maps, micrographs and
# search outputs. All of it is regenerable from the scripts and configs that ARE tracked
# -- models/build_*.py rebuild the PDBs, simulate_*.py the maps and synthetics, and
# run_match_*.py the searches -- so none of it belongs in the repository.

maps/
Frames/
results_full/
results_cropped/
results_curved/

# Fetched depositions and the models built from them.
models/*.cif
models/*.pdb

# Constraint sidecars carry a per-pixel map per micrograph; the YAML beside them is
# tracked, and make_filament_constraint.py rebuilds the HDF5 from the drawn paths.
configs/*.h5
configs/._*

# Rendered figures and the status deck, both built by make_status_deck.py.
*.pdf
*.png
*.parquet
*.csv
